OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 9 JAN
OL,4,G2300FThe Rock Show with Shaun Keaveny
OL,5,     GRockin' into 2026 with new
OL,6,     Greleases and artists due the play
OL,7,     Glive on these shores this year,
OL,8,     Gplus a Rock God from musician and
OL,9,     Grock fan Fabio Zaffagnini,
OL,10,     Gfounder of 'Rockin'1000'.
OL,11,G0000FRomesh Ranganathan: For the Love
OL,12,     Fof Hip Hop
OL,13,     GRomesh is joined by Brighton
OL,14,     Grapper ArrDee. He picks three
OL,15,     Gtracks that have inspired his
OL,16,     Gjourney and shares his latest
OL,17,     Gsingle. Plus music from Naughty
OL,18,     GBy Nature and Common.
